  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Grants <pve 40% /> <pvp [20%] /> | <pve 80% /> <pvp [40%] /> | <pve 120% /> <pvp [60%] /> Increased Base Class Ability Regeneration Rate while within 15 meters of 1|2|3 allies. \n\nCasting your rift grants an 'Arc Soul' to allies inside it for 15 seconds. Arc Souls fire homing projectiles in a 3-round burst at 100 RPM towards enemies within 24 meters. \n\nWhile <arc/>Amplified, Arc Soul fires a 5-round burst at 225 RPM.\n\nArc Souls count as grenade abilities and are buffed by, and trigger, grenade-specific effects.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T20:01:45.017Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
